---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import peter from '../assets/peter.jpg'
import { icon, pill } from '../lib/icons'
import { site } from '../lib/site'

const manifests = [
  'deployment.yaml',
  'service.yaml',
  'ingress.yaml',
  'hpa.yaml',
  'pdb.yaml',
  'certificate.yaml',
  'networkpolicy.yaml',
]
---

<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="letter">
      <aside class="who">
        <Image
          src={peter}
          alt="Peter Kota"
          width={112}
          height={112}
          densities={[1, 2, 4]}
          class="photo"
        />
        <div>
          <div class="name">Peter Kota</div>
          <div class="role">
            Creator of KubeStacks.
            <br />
            Works on Sevalla.
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="gh" href={site.author.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          @kotapeter
        </a>
      </aside>

      <div class="body">
        <span class="eyebrow">Why I built it</span>
        <p class="pull">
          I wanted to open a cluster and know in a second whether it was healthy, and if it wasn’t,
          where to look first.
        </p>
        <div class="text">
          <p>
            I work on{' '}
            <a href={site.sevalla} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Sevalla
            </a>
            . It runs apps, databases and static sites on Kubernetes, and the whole point is that
            our users never have to think about Kubernetes. They push code, and we look after the
            clusters.
          </p>
          <p>
            That means we watch a lot of clusters. Every day I’d jump between them to check on
            nodes, pods and capacity. The tools I had were a terminal or a wall of tables. They
            could tell me anything, just not at a glance.
          </p>
          <p>
            I like to see things. A failing pod should look like a failing pod, and a node that’s
            out of memory should stand out before anyone has to ask. So I built the app I wanted to
            open every morning.
          </p>
          <p>
            KubeStacks started as a tool for my own work. It’s free and open source, because anyone
            who runs a cluster should have one like it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="sign">Peter</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="sevalla" aria-labelledby="sevalla-title">
      <div class="s-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Rather not run Kubernetes?</span>
        <h2 id="sevalla-title">Sevalla keeps the clusters out of your way.</h2>
        <p>
          Push your code and Sevalla builds it, runs it and scales it on Kubernetes, with databases,
          object storage and static sites next to it. You pay for the resources you use, and you
          never write a manifest.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={site.sevalla} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Try Sevalla
          <Fragment set:html={icon('arrow-up-right')} />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="s-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <ul class="files">
          {manifests.map((m) => (
            <li>{m}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="brace"></div>
        <div class="push">
          <code>
            <span class="prompt">$</span> git push
          </code>
          <Fragment set:html={pill('healthy', 'Deployed')} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    padding-block: clamp(72px, 10vw, 140px) clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
    position: relative;
  }

  .story::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0 0 auto;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--line-strong), transparent);
  }

  .letter {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 4fr) minmax(0, 8fr);
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
  }

  .who {
    position: sticky;
    top: 96px;
    align-self: start;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .who :global(.photo) {
    width: 112px;
    height: 112px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px var(--window-edge),
      var(--shadow-panel);
    filter: saturate(0.9);
  }

  .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .role {
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .gh {
    font: 500 0.8125rem/1 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .gh:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .pull {
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 1.2rem + 1.6vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 560;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 32;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1em;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .text a {
    color: var(--text-1);
    text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .text a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .sign {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .sign::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    margin-right: 12px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    background: var(--text-3);
  }

  /* Sevalla, as the other half of the same idea. */
  .sevalla {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px);
    margin-top: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px);
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(80% 120% at 100% 50%, rgb(57 135 229 / 0.08), transparent 60%), var(--surface);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }

  .s-copy {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .s-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.2rem + 1.2vw, 2.125rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .s-copy p {
    color: var(--text-2);
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .s-art {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 28px auto;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .files {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font: 400 12.5px/1 var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .files li {
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
  }

  .brace {
    align-self: stretch;
    margin-block: 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-left: 0;
    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .brace::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 100%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 18px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .push {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--code-bg);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-strong),
      0 20px 40px -24px rgb(57 135 229 / 0.5);
  }

  .push code {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .files li {
        animation: fold linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: cover 30% cover 55%;
      }
    }
  }

  /* The manifests get crossed out as the card scrolls in: git push replaces them. */
  @keyframes fold {
    to {
      opacity: 0.5;
      text-decoration: line-through;
      text-decoration-color: var(--text-3);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .letter,
    .sevalla {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .who {
      position: static;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .who :global(.photo) {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .gh {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .s-art {
      grid-template-columns: auto 20px auto;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .files {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }
</style>
